@page "/implementation-plan"

<PageTitle>Implementation Plan - OperationsFlow</PageTitle>

<PageHero
    Eyebrow="Roadmap"
    Title="Implementation Plan"
    Subtitle="Outline the staged path from local prototype to hybrid Microsoft 365 implementation and full production-style workflow."
    BadgeText="Week 2"
    BadgeClass="of-badge-info">
    <Actions>
        <a class="of-btn of-btn-secondary" href="/portfolio-hub">Portfolio Hub</a>
        <a class="of-btn of-btn-secondary" href="/reviewer-checklist">Reviewer Checklist</a>
        <a class="of-btn of-btn-secondary" href="/demo-guide">Demo Guide</a>
    </Actions>
</PageHero>

<PurposeNote Title="Purpose" Icon="📌">
    <p>The next stages are hybrid mapping, Microsoft 365 test tenant implementation, Power Automate notifications, Power BI reporting, and production hardening.</p>
</PurposeNote>

<MetricGrid>
    <MetricCard Title="Workflow MVP" Value="Week 2" Detail="Create/edit, reminders, workload, reporting, and traceability" Icon="✅" Tone="success" />
    <MetricCard Title="Prototype" Value="SQLite" Detail="Local demo data, not production deployment" Icon="🧪" Tone="info" />
    <MetricCard Title="Evidence" Value="Ready" Detail="Supports screenshots, walkthroughs, and review notes" Icon="📦" Tone="success" />
    <MetricCard Title="Next Stage" Value="M365" Detail="SharePoint, Lists, Power Automate, and Power BI direction" Icon="🔗" Tone="warning" />
</MetricGrid>

<InfoPanel Title="Review Summary" Subtitle="What this page should communicate to a reviewer.">
    <ChildContent>
        <div class="of-review-proof-grid">
            <div class="of-review-proof-card">
                <strong>Business Context</strong>
                <span>Explains why the workflow exists and what problem it solves.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="of-review-proof-card">
                <strong>Technical Context</strong>
                <span>Connects the local Blazor/SQLite prototype to a realistic implementation path.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="of-review-proof-card">
                <strong>Portfolio Context</strong>
                <span>Shows the project as evidence of systems thinking, not just UI layout.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="of-review-proof-card">
                <strong>Boundary Context</strong>
                <span>Keeps the prototype honest about what is and is not production-ready.</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </ChildContent>
</InfoPanel>

<InfoPanel Title="Key Points" Subtitle="Use these notes when walking through the project.">
    <ChildContent>
        <ol class="of-review-steps">
            <li>OperationsFlow captures work before it disappears into emails, conversations, spreadsheets, or paper notes.</li>
            <li>Records feed management views such as Reminders, Workload, Reports, Data Quality, and Activity Log.</li>
            <li>Corrective actions can be source-linked from risks, training, and controlled documents.</li>
            <li>Activity history provides traceability evidence for create, update, and review workflows.</li>
            <li>The project is Microsoft 365-ready in design, but still a local SQLite demo prototype.</li>
        </ol>
    </ChildContent>
</InfoPanel>

<InfoPanel Title="Connected Review Links" Subtitle="Open the main evidence pages from here.">
    <ChildContent>
        <div class="of-review-proof-grid">
            <a class="of-review-proof-card of-click-card" href="/reports"><strong>Reports</strong><span>Management reporting and CSV export evidence.</span></a>
            <a class="of-review-proof-card of-click-card" href="/data-quality"><strong>Data Quality</strong><span>Weak records, overdue work, and review issues.</span></a>
            <a class="of-review-proof-card of-click-card" href="/activity-log"><strong>Activity Log</strong><span>Global traceability and workflow evidence.</span></a>
            <a class="of-review-proof-card of-click-card" href="/implementation-plan"><strong>Implementation Plan</strong><span>Week 3/4 hybrid and Microsoft 365 direction.</span></a>
        </div>
    </ChildContent>
</InfoPanel>

<GuidanceNote Title="Prototype Boundary" Icon="🚧" Tone="warning">
    <ul>
        <li>This page is part of the portfolio review layer.</li>
        <li>The current app uses local SQLite demo data.</li>
        <li>Production rollout would need authentication, permissions, audit retention, Microsoft 365 integration, backups, and operational ownership.</li>
    </ul>
</GuidanceNote>
